CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'skb->len < RX_URB_SIZE'
#156: FILE: drivers/staging/rtl8192u/r8192U_core.c:4736:
+	if ((skb->len >= (20 + sizeof(struct rx_desc_819x_usb))) && (skb->len < RX_URB_SIZE)) {

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

      &(foo->bar)
      *(foo->bar)

    could be::

      &foo->bar
      *foo->bar

